      "content": "okay i didn't know about the reye's thing thanks. i do have some tylenol but i'm not sure how much to give him since he's small. he's like 50lbs. how many of the regular adult strength ones (500mg) could i break up and give him to make sure it's enough to work? i'm just worried the kids version is too weak and won't touch this fever.",
